    "releaseNotes": "2.2.1 : pr\u00e9requis Astra Framework [3.0.0, 5.0.0), compatible avec le framework 4.1.0. Plage \u00e9largie aux frameworks 4.x ; contenu et code inchang\u00e9s. 2.2.0: requires astra.tactics 2.2.0 and framework 3.0.0 (Echo and Pulse as packages, no content change). Depends on astra.tactics [2.2.0, 3.0.0). Requires astra-framework [3.0.0, 4.0.0); on a 2.x framework the import does not compile. 2.1.0: chapters authored as text (Chapters/*.txt, read by the builder) and edited in Tactics Studio; chapter names and objectives are label keys of Localization/tactics-en; player units are deploy slots; Aegis rule assets and TacticsPlaytestSettings for the studio Play button. Requires astra.tactics 2.1.0.",
